# prettier runs here for .astro components, .mjs/.ts utils, CSS and JSON —
# but NEVER for the page sources: prettier's MDX formatter inserts a blank line
# after an opening `(` inside a JSX expression, which terminates the expression
# and breaks the Astro build with a bare `Parse error @:1:1` (verified with
# prettier 3.9.9 on astro 7.3.5). The pages are hand-formatted to the repo style
# (100-col wrap, single quotes, no semicolons) and validated by
# `pnpm build` → `astro check`, which is the gate that actually understands MDX.
**/*.mdx
node_modules
dist
.astro
pnpm-lock.yaml